 <html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover"><meta name="theme-color" content="#101114"><title>Ashen Path — Roguelike Auto-Battler</title>
 <style>
